 ex=("Why did Ashoka have edicts carved on rocks and pillars?",[("He wanted to share messages with all his people.","Many could not read books."),("Stones last for centuries and can be placed in public places.","Everyone could see them."),("So the edicts spread his ideas of kindness and dhamma.","They are also a source of history for us.")]),
