 ex=("Why is the invention of the zero so important?",[("Zero lets us show place value, for example ten as one and zero.","Numbers become easy to write."),("It makes calculation with big numbers simple.","Arithmetic becomes fast."),("The world still uses this system, so zero changed mathematics.","It came through Indian scholars.")]),
