 ex=("How does a pilgrimage help the people of the place that is visited?",[("Pilgrims need food, shelter and goods.","They spend money locally."),("Shopkeepers, guides and boatmen earn from the visitors.","Local jobs are created."),("So pilgrimage supports the local economy and brings people together.","It also needs care of the place.")]),
 tb=("A friend throws plastic into a sacred river. What will you say?",["Sacred rivers must be kept clean and respected.","Plastic harms the river and the people who depend on it."],["Neglecting sacred places."]),
